OL,3,GNEWSABuilding more data centres could
OL,4,Apush up electricity prices, Holyrood
OL,5,Acommittee warned
OL,6,
OL,7,FBuilding more data centres could push
OL,8,Fup electricity prices for consumers and
OL,9,Fchallenge climate change targets, MSPs
OL,10,Fhave been told.
OL,12,FScotland has been identified as a key
OL,13,Flocation for building hyperscale AI
OL,14,Fdata centres because of the high
OL,15,Fpotential for renewable energy,
OL,16,Fprincipally from wind.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
