OL,3,GNEWSABuilding more data centres could
OL,4,Apush up electricity prices, Holyrood
OL,5,Acommittee warned
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut academics have warned that could
OL,8,Fstill result in more gas being used to
OL,9,Fcreate electricity at times of low wind
OL,10,Fand solar power, which has been driving
OL,11,Fup prices in the Republic of Ireland
OL,12,Fand the US.
OL,14,FThe National Energy System Operator
OL,15,F(Neso) said plans were in place to
OL,16,Fdecouple the high cost of gas from
OL,17,Fbills.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
